dspy:metricFunction a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain dspy:Optimizer ; rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    rdfs:comment "Python identifier naming the metric function ggen scaffolds as a NotImplementedError stub. The metric body is arbitrary business logic, out of ontology scope." .

